together, all right? Get Mama, get everybody.


00:47:33.465 --> 00:47:35.160
<i>All right?
Okay.</i>


00:47:51.116 --> 00:47:52.378
Hey, Frank!


00:47:52.484 --> 00:47:53.746
What's happening, Frank?


00:47:53.852 --> 00:47:56.412
Hey, Frankie.
How you doing, Uncle Frank?


00:47:56.522 --> 00:47:58.854
Get out the car.
Get the kids, get the kids.


00:48:00.359 --> 00:48:01.849
Look at this, baby.


00:48:01.994 --> 00:48:05.987
Oh, my Lord!
I'm so glad to see you, boy.


00:48:06.298 --> 00:48:10.758
