people are doing here?


00:48:13.572 --> 00:48:14.937
And whose
house is that, Frankie?


00:48:15.040 --> 00:48:17.201
That is your house, Mama.


00:48:17.809 --> 00:48:19.970
Mine?
That's yours.


00:48:20.846 --> 00:48:22.507
And who else?


00:48:23.815 --> 00:48:27.945
Now, there, that's my room right
there, man. Right over there.


00:48:34.226 --> 00:48:36.490
Anybody want some
more collard greens?


00:48:38.230 --> 00:48:42.633
I wanna tell you how happy I am
to see all my children at the table


00:48:42.734 --> 00:48:45.202
and the grandchildren
at the same time.


00:48:45.337 --> 00:48:47.066
My heart's so happy.
Enjoy yourselves.


00:48:47.172 --> 00:48:48.662
Right on, Grandma.


00:48:49.408 --> 00:48:51.740
I hope you got a job, boy, the
way you're eating over here.


00:48:51.877 --> 00:48:55.711
That boy right there, he got a arm
on him. I mean, a major league arm.


00:48:55.847 --> 00:48:56.814
Oh, yeah?


00:48:56.915 --> 00:48:58.348
Ain't that right?


00:48:58.450 --> 00:48:59.576
Right on, Pop.


00:48:59.685 --> 00:49:02.210
Well, we'll see after dinner. We'll
