00:49:02.354 --> 00:49:04.015
No, no, you can't
catch him, man.


00:49:04.122 --> 00:49:05.487
I'm talking about...
I'm talking about...


00:49:05.591 --> 00:49:07.252
This guy throw harder
than Gibson.


00:49:07.392 --> 00:49:09.656
We're talking
95 miles an hour.


00:49:10.062 --> 00:49:12.030
Can you catch him?
He gonna...


00:49:12.130 --> 00:49:13.654
He gonna catch the ground.


00:49:13.765 --> 00:49:16.427
We might've played catch, I think,
when I was about five years old.


00:49:16.568 --> 00:49:18.900
Since then, he ain't been
able to keep up.


00:49:21.940 --> 00:49:24.408
This is your room.
It's perfect.


00:49:25.410 --> 00:49:27.344
Oh. Why, it's...


00:49:27.713 --> 00:49:29.704
Will you look at this?


00:49:29.915 --> 00:49:31.382
Oh!


00:49:32.117 --> 00:49:35.280
Oh, it's beautiful.
It's beautiful. It's just...


00:49:35.887 --> 00:49:36.876
I...


00:49:43.462 --> 00:49:44.952
How did you...


00:49:45.063 --> 00:49:46.291
I had it made.


00:49:48.300 --> 00:49:49.597
From memory.


00:49:49.735 --> 00:49:51.896
You were five when they took
it away on me. That's right.


00:49:52.004 --> 00:49:53.164
How could you remember it?


00:49:53.272 --> 00:49:54.864
How could I forget, Mama?


00:49:59.578 --> 00:50:03.105
I'll just
tell you it is perfect.


00:50:03.682 --> 00:50:05.877
It's all perfect.


00:50:10.922 --> 00:50:13.584
I can't tell you
how much I love you.


00:50:13.692 --> 00:50:15.421
I love you, too, Mama.


00:50:16.194 --> 00:50:17.320
It's okay.


00:50:26.138 --> 00:50:28.163
Both these guys,
good with wires,


00:50:28.307 --> 00:50:29.899
they got solid informants,


00:50:30.008 --> 00:50:32.499
and they're honest
and they're fearless.


00:50:33.045 --> 00:50:35.570
They're insane,
Richie, like you.


00:50:36.114 --> 00:50:37.604
Where are they?


00:50:39.818 --> 00:50:43.345
That's Jones with
the skinny white broad.


00:50:43.455 --> 00:50:45.116
Best I ever seen
on the street.


00:50:45.223 --> 00:50:48.750
He knows dope, but he's
