00:50:48.860 --> 00:50:51.260
He's a stand-up
guy all round.


00:50:51.363 --> 00:50:54.855
And that's Abruzzo
with the two fat black ones.


00:50:55.901 --> 00:50:58.426
He loves a big ass, man.


00:50:58.804 --> 00:51:03.138
He's a bulldog. He don't fuck around,
all right. He's got a bit of a temper,


00:51:03.275 --> 00:51:06.642
yeah, but you can trust this
guy with your grandmother.


00:51:06.978 --> 00:51:09.037
Listen, Richie.
We work together.


00:51:09.147 --> 00:51:11.638
You want me,
you gotta take them, too.


00:51:23.795 --> 00:51:24.887
When do we start?


00:51:28.066 --> 00:51:31.035
The man I worked for, he had one of
the biggest companies in New York City.


00:51:31.136 --> 00:51:33.798
He ran it for more
than 50 years.


00:51:34.072 --> 00:51:37.803
Fifteen years, eight
months and nine days,


00:51:37.909 --> 00:51:39.501
I was with him every day.
I worked for him,


00:51:39.644 --> 00:51:43.375
I protected him, I looked
after him, I learned from him.


00:51:43.882 --> 00:51:46.510
Bumpy was rich, but he wasn't
