00:51:46.618 --> 00:51:48.085
He wasn't wealthy.


00:51:48.186 --> 00:51:50.518
He didn't own his own company.
He thought he did, but he didn't,


00:51:50.655 --> 00:51:52.213
he just managed it.


00:51:52.357 --> 00:51:54.723
The white man owned it,
so they owned him.


00:51:54.860 --> 00:51:56.225
Nobody owns me, though.
Hey.


00:51:56.361 --> 00:51:58.295
How you doing, babe?
Good.


00:51:58.397 --> 00:52:01.025
That's 'cause I own my own company,
and my company sells a product


00:52:01.166 --> 00:52:03.794
