Twenty percent.


00:53:43.301 --> 00:53:45.895
Oh, you got the jar?
That's right.


00:53:46.872 --> 00:53:48.305
Get the fuck out of here...
Oh! What you gonna do?


00:53:49.674 --> 00:53:52.165
