00:53:59.050 --> 00:54:00.312
Shit.


00:54:12.163 --> 00:54:14.996
There you go.
Twenty percent.


00:54:38.540 --> 00:54:40.371
So, what was I saying?


00:54:49.651 --> 00:54:50.618
Jones.


00:54:52.521 --> 00:54:54.216
Jonesy.


00:54:56.191 --> 00:54:57.624
That was nice, man.


00:54:59.060 --> 00:55:00.584
Just doing my melodious thing, baby.


00:55:00.762 --> 00:55:02.286
Got you.


00:55:09.121 --> 00:55:12.454
This is the newly formed
Essex County Narcotics Squad.


00:55:13.859 --> 00:55:17.420
Our mandate is to make major
arrests. No street guys.


00:55:18.497 --> 00:55:21.591
We're looking for the
suppliers and the distributors.


00:55:21.700 --> 00:55:24.828
Heroin, cocaine, amphetamines.
No grass under 1,000 pounds.


00:55:24.970 --> 00:55:26.665
No powder under 40 kilograms.


00:55:26.805 --> 00:55:28.739
Any less than that, then somebody
else can waste their time.


00:55:28.840 --> 00:55:32.571
We gonna be handling the big shipments,
the big money and the big temptation.


00:55:32.677 --> 00:55:33.905
I heard
a story about you.


00:55:34.012 --> 00:55:36.776
That you found a million
dollars in unmarked cash


00:55:36.882 --> 00:55:39.680
