00:59:52.137 --> 00:59:53.695
I ain't got no problem with
Nicky. Oh, you like Nicky?


00:59:53.805 --> 00:59:55.067
Yeah!
You want to be like Nicky?


00:59:55.206 --> 00:59:57.868
