You wanna work for him?


00:59:57.976 --> 00:59:59.773
Share a jail cell with him?
Maybe cook for him?


00:59:59.911 --> 01:00:00.900
He wants to talk to you.


01:00:01.045 --> 01:00:03.912
Oh, so now you talking to
him about me? What? You...


