02:32:34.699 --> 02:32:38.066
Respectfully, ma'am, please step
inside. Thank you. Step inside.


02:32:49.381 --> 02:32:51.781
Hands up against the wall.
Stay back.


02:32:54.152 --> 02:32:55.483
Oh, man.


02:32:55.620 --> 02:32:58.316
Don't you owe me money? I'll
