02:33:00.158 --> 02:33:02.251
Yo, yo! Pigs! Look out!


02:33:02.360 --> 02:33:04.419
NYPD!
Everybody stand still!


02:33:07.499 --> 02:33:09.023
Turner! Go!


02:33:10.535 --> 02:33:12.628
Down on the ground,
