02:35:38.516 --> 02:35:40.848
It was the right thing to do.
That's true.


02:35:41.286 --> 02:35:43.254
That's a good answer.
It was the right thing to do.


02:35:43.388 --> 02:35:45.583
The question I have, the question
I've been asking myself is,


02:35:45.690 --> 02:35:47.282
would you do it again?


02:35:48.560 --> 02:35:51.461
I mean, that's a lot of money,
that's a long time ago.


02:35:51.896 --> 02:35:55.423
Many car payments ago, many
child support payments ago.


02:35:57.202 --> 02:36:01.036
So I said to myself, the onlyest
