anything on them streets?


02:36:36.274 --> 02:36:37.901
Them dope fiends
is gonna shoot it,


02:36:38.009 --> 02:36:40.136
they're gonna steal for it,
they're gonna die for it.


02:36:40.245 --> 02:36:43.009
Putting me in or out
ain't gonna change one thing.


02:36:43.381 --> 02:36:44.643
Then that's the way it is.


02:36:44.749 --> 02:36:46.580
That's just the way it is.
So what we got, Richie?


02:36:46.785 --> 02:36:48.548
We got me and you
sitting here.


02:36:48.853 --> 02:36:51.754
<i>We got that little snitch-ass
driver for my brother.</i>


02:36:51.856 --> 02:36:53.323
<i>You got a little
bit of powder.</i>


02:36:53.625 --> 02:36:55.490
<i>You're going to need
more than that, Richie.</i>


02:36:55.760 --> 02:36:59.252
<i>I got possession,
supply, conspiracy,</i>


02:36:59.464 --> 02:37:03.560
<i>bribing a law officer. I got people who'll
attest to seeing you kill in cold blood.</i>


02:37:03.702 --> 02:37:07.604
I got your offshore bank accounts,
your real estate, your businesses,


02:37:07.739 --> 02:37:10.207
