everything can return to normal.


02:38:16.908 --> 02:38:18.136
My man.


02:38:22.981 --> 02:38:24.972
You know what normal
is to me, Richie?


02:38:25.283 --> 02:38:28.184
I ain't seen normal since
I was six years old.


02:38:29.821 --> 02:38:32.415
Normal is seeing the police
right up to my house


02:38:32.524 --> 02:38:35.459
