crime figures. You can have them.


02:39:39.257 --> 02:39:40.690
I'll take them, too.


02:39:40.959 --> 02:39:42.859
You'll take them, too?


02:39:48.032 --> 02:39:51.695
No, you didn't. You're talking
about police. You want police?


02:39:52.270 --> 02:39:53.396
