02:39:53.505 --> 02:39:54.767
They're not my kind.


02:39:55.540 --> 02:39:58.100
They're in business with you,
Frank. They ain't my kind.


02:39:58.376 --> 02:40:02.278
They ain't my kind like the
Italians are not yours. All right?


02:40:05.283 --> 02:40:06.272
Huh.


02:40:15.860 --> 02:40:18.226
What can you
promise me, Richie?


02:40:21.266 --> 02:40:24.235
