02:41:45.116 --> 02:41:47.584
<i>A report by federal
investigators into New York's</i>


02:41:47.685 --> 02:41:49.778
<i>everwidening police
corruption scandal</i>


02:41:49.887 --> 02:41:52.515
<i>claims that more than
half of the city's officers</i>


02:41:52.657 --> 02:41:56.684
<i>assigned to drug enforcement have
