02:41:57.829 --> 02:42:01.128
<i>Allegations of widespread
corruption within</i>


02:42:01.232 --> 02:42:03.700
<i>the elite narcotics squad SIU</i>


02:42:03.835 --> 02:42:06.668
<i>have led to the arrest of
more New York City detectives.</i>


02:42:07.572 --> 02:42:08.834
<i>Convicted of extortion,</i>


02:42:08.973 --> 02:42:12.204
<i>members of New York City's Special
Investigations Narcotics Unit</i>


02:42:12.343 --> 02:42:15.369
<i>will face sentencing
today in federal court.</i>


02:42:17.315 --> 02:42:20.216
MacNamara. Vendazzo.


02:42:21.419 --> 02:42:22.716
Trupo.


02:42:26.024 --> 02:42:27.457
You are special.


02:43:10.868 --> 02:43:12.733
It's good work, Frank.


02:43:14.038 --> 02:43:15.403
You know...


02:43:15.606 --> 02:43:19.235
