02:45:32.793 --> 02:45:35.261
Frank. There you are.


02:45:36.096 --> 02:45:37.324
Caffe latte. Yeah.


02:45:37.431 --> 02:45:38.591
Latte?


02:45:38.699 --> 02:45:40.030
Oh, shit. Yeah.


