Boulevard now?


02:46:45.665 --> 02:46:47.064
This was me Richie,
right here.


02:46:47.234 --> 02:46:48.667
This was all me.


02:46:50.237 --> 02:46:52.364
In my day there were so many
niggers out here buying dope


02:46:52.472 --> 02:46:55.134
<i>you could've made
