02:47:33.346 --> 02:47:35.780
Coming to gangsters.


02:47:39.519 --> 02:47:40.486
What?


02:47:42.989 --> 02:47:45.890
Ain't nothin', man.
Ain't nothin', man.


02:47:46.726 --> 02:47:48.853
That's life right there.
That's life right there.


02:47:49.329 --> 02:47:52.526
